## Open questions for you (the fun part)

- **What is the "clicking" actually?** Do you click enemies, click an upgrade
  button, or click to place/shoot? (NGU has manual combat; RI has none.)
- **Tower placement:** For now, you see a tower of each purchased type on the left side of the map, with a x # underneath. Ammunitions will fire from the left edge of the map toward the horde in accordance to how many are purchased. each shot chooses its y axis.
- **Failure shape:** Maybe gradually worsens depending on how much damage they do. taking currency, disabling towers for a time, a full loverwhelm forces prestige
- **Is the enemy stream one dial or several** stream speed, chance of neighbor enemy spawn (this is how enemy horde stream widens, neighbor enemies spawn at the same time at different verticies), health
- **Meta layer:** one reset, or a stack with different metrics per layer (`#21`)?
- **Theme/skin** sprite tower defense, zoom in / out for more / less detail
